      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 2D-animated, anime-style painted illustration, cinematic, a high wide shot preserves the exact composition of <Picture 1>: tall green grass filling the bottom of the frame, a mist-filled valley holding a fantasy city of steep red-tiled and blue-slate roofs, a pale winding river crossed by several stone arch bridges, a large grey gothic cathedral with clustered spires on the right, a slender lone tower on the far left, layered blue hills behind, and a heavy bank of dark storm clouds with one bright opening near the horizon. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed while the cloud layer drifts slowly to the right and the bright opening widens, so the sunbeams already present in <Picture 1> sharpen into distinct shafts that sweep down across the cathedral spires and the rooftops. Mist ribbons in the valley curl upward and thin out, the river surface brightens where the light lands on it, warm window lights flicker in the houses along the riverbank, and the foreground grass blades bend and ripple continuously in the wind until the end of the shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: A steady wind rushes through the tall foreground grass and rises slightly in the middle of the shot, layered over a low, hollow valley ambience. Faint running water and thin distant birdcalls drift up from the city below.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sustained low strings at a slow tempo beneath a soft wordless choir. A single high string line and a light cymbal swell grow in volume as the shafts of light widen, holding through the final second.",
